Z||000000||CUTTER||06-14-2000||04:12 PM||||Well got back from the beach today and there was people racing down there at almost every red light. I had so much fun, I didnt even get to go on the beach because of it. I was driving down the street and a new 2000 celica GT pulled up beside me and said he wanted to race. So we hit the next redlight and he said it was a stock 4cyl....? Do the GT's have 4cyls? Then he asked what all that Holley sh*t was on the side of my car (air scoop) and I said "oh it is.....ummmm.....well its nothing" he was like yeah right! so the light turned green and we took off and he was way behind, then he came up again and said again that he was just testing my power, I was like ummmm.....ok, and we lined up again at the redlight, this time when it turned green he chirped the tires and i heard him reving every gear to around 5-6000rpm but he was still about 2 car lengths behind. Then at the next light he pulls up and says "oh It tachs out at 7000 and i only took it to 5" then he said it wasnt his car it was his friends and he doesnt like stick. Um I bet if he woulda beat me he wouldnt be teling me that stuff!<BR>Also when I was driving a new mirage pulls up beside me and I rev it, and he laughs and says "I'll give you a 5 second head start" I was like ok and i slamed on the gas when i was going 25mph, (you know the feeling when your going 25 and slam the gas so it pounds into 1st gear) I took off like a bat outa hell and right after I slamed on it I heard him slam on it but it was too late and I killed him, I seen him the next night at the same place and he didnt even try anything or look at me! also blew away a integra non vtech and plenty of civics and other rice burners. Well thats really all i have to say so talk to you all later!!<BR>CUTTER||||reg||6
